dger URLs recorded as A1 evidence are absent from their items and I did **not** add them, since neither is in A3's approved set:\n\n- `cor-monotone-converges-iff-bounded` — `https://www.jirka.org/ra/`, the Lebl **landing page**. §4d's whole finding is that a landing page is not evidence; I added the clause-carrying section instead.\n- `rem-completeness-routes` — `https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archimedean_property`, live and clause-carrying, just outside §5b. A one-line addition if Alpha wants it; no gate depends on it.\n\nWritten this stage: the 31 item frontmatter blocks, the applier script, `research/audit/wave5-real-analysis.findings.md`, and two snapshot rows in `wave5-touches.json`. Not touched: the provenance ledger, the proof-contract file, any other batch's files."
