research/audit/wave12-dispatch/audit-refuter-thm-c-k-complete-in-the-sup-metric.prompt.md:119:[L5] A uniform limit of continuous real-valued functions on a metric space is continuous ([[thm-uniform-limit-continuous-real-functions]]).
